    <string name="onboarding_title_1">NaviTV brauzeriga xush kelibsiz</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_1">Android TV-da veb-sahifalarni pult, klaviatura yoki sichqoncha yordamida ko‘ring. Tugmalar orasida va sahifa ichida harakatlanish uchun D-paddan foydalaning.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_2">Sichqoncha va ko‘rsatkich rejimi</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_2">Ko‘rsatkichni D-pad bilan harakatlantirish va OK bilan bosish uchun Sichqoncha rejimini yoqing. Istalgan vaqtda USB yoki Bluetooth sichqonchani ulang — u darhol ishlaydi.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_3">Sevimli sahifalaringizni saqlang</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_3">Sahifalarni xatcho‘pga qo‘shish uchun yulduzcha tugmasidan foydalaning. Saqlangan xatcho‘plar va tarixni istalgan vaqtda asboblar panelidan oching.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_title_4">Hamma narsa tayyor</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message_4">Tarix avtomatik ravishda saqlanadi. Bosh sahifangizni o‘zgartirish, reklama bloklash yoki ma’lumotlarni tozalash uchun Sozlamalarga kiring.</string>
    <string name="rating_title">NaviTV brauzeri yoqyaptimi?</string>
    <string name="rating_message">Agar ilova yoqqan bo‘lsa, uni baholashingizni so‘raymiz. Bu bizga takomillashishga yordam beradi!</string>
